# Cache rules for the Worker's static files (Cloudflare Workers static assets read this file; web-app/README.md
# "Updates reach open pages"). Hashed files never change: cached for a year. The list of kept files is read fresh.
# Documents are the Worker's own answers (src/server/gates.ts finish(): no-cache), not covered here.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/build-assets.json
  Cache-Control: no-cache
